libvips 8.18 branch after 8.18.7, commit 31fd321f2b0e:
https://github.com/libvips/libvips/commit/31fd321f2b0e09af4dbfb7fd5221f57741b8a267

heifload with several pages (n=-1, a HEIF sequence or a file of many images):
the height of the output, the height of a page times the number of pages, was
computed in int without a check and could overflow into a wrong, smaller
height; now the page size and the total height are checked against
VIPS_MAX_COORD ("image too large"). patch-heifload-2-max-items applies after
it.

